.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-runner-controller-get \- Get details of a runner controller. (EXPERIMENTAL)


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab runner-controller get  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Retrieves details of a single runner controller, including its
connection status. This is an administrator-only feature.

.PP
This feature is an experiment and is not ready for production use.
It might be unstable or removed at any time.
For more information, see
https://docs.gitlab.com/policy/development_stages_support/.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Get runner controller with ID 42
glab runner-controller get 42

# Get runner controller as JSON
glab runner-controller get 42 --output json
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-runner-controller(1)\fP
